<panel>
  <style>
    .root {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12;
      gap: 5;
      background-color: rgba(0, 8, 24, 0.92);
      border-radius: 8;
      border-color: #224488;
      border-width: 1;
      width: 300;
    }
    .title {
      font-size: 14;
      color: #00ffff;
    }
    .section {
      font-size: 10;
      color: #66aacc;
      margin-top: 4;
    }
    .text {
      font-size: 9;
      color: #aabbcc;
    }
    .controls {
      font-size: 8;
      color: #889999;
    }
    .back-btn {
      font-size: 9;
      color: #aabbcc;
      background-color: #1a1a3e;
      padding: 6;
      border-radius: 4;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 6;
    }
  </style>
  <container class="root">
    <text class="title">HOW TO PLAY</text>
    <text class="section">Objective</text>
    <text class="text">Crack the secret code! Guess the hidden sequence of colored pegs. After each guess, feedback pegs reveal how close you are.</text>
    <text class="section">Feedback Pegs</text>
    <text class="text">White peg = right color, right position. Colored peg = right color, wrong position. Empty = wrong color.</text>
    <text class="section">Controls (Keyboard)</text>
    <text class="controls">Left/Right: Select color</text>
    <text class="controls">Up/Down: Navigate peg slots</text>
    <text class="controls">Space/Enter: Place peg</text>
    <text class="controls">Z: Undo last peg</text>
    <text class="controls">R: Submit guess</text>
    <text class="controls">H: Use hint
    <text class="controls">C: Clear all pegs in row</text>
    <text class="controls">Esc: Pause</text>
    <text class="section">Controls (VR)</text>
    <text class="controls">Thumbstick: Select color / navigate</text>
    <text class="controls">A: Place peg, B: Submit guess</text>
    <text class="controls">Y: Undo, X (left): Pause</text>
    <text class="controls">Ray pointer: Click slots/colors</text>
    <text class="section">Game Modes</text>
    <text class="controls">Classic: Standard rules</text>
    <text class="controls">Speed: 120s time limit</text>
    <text class="controls">Zen: Unlimited guesses, 3 hints</text>
    <text class="controls">Challenge: Fewer guesses allowed</text>
    <text class="controls">Daily: Same puzzle for everyone today</text>
    <text class="section">Hints and Deduction</text>
    <text class="controls">Press H or tap Use Hint to reveal one correct peg position. The HUD shows confirmed positions and eliminated colors to help you deduce the code.</text>
    <text name="btn-back" class="back-btn">Back</text>
  </container>
</panel>
